<title>JAPAN: Ebara says to unveil tie-up with Dow Chemical unit.</title>
<headline>Ebara says to unveil tie-up with Dow Chemical unit.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ebara Corp said on Monday that it would unveil a business tie-up with an environmental business unit of Dow Chemical Co at 0230 GMT.  </p>
<p>An Ebara spokesman said the two companies would issue separate statements on the tie-up.</p>
<p>He did not give further details.</p>
<p>Ebara manufactures machinery used in garbage and industrial-waste disposal.</p>
</text>
